# Implementation Plan: MediSense Production-Grade REST API Layer & Rate Limiting

Build the complete production-grade REST API layer in `com.medisense.api` featuring Bucket4j + Redis distributed rate limiting across 5 Tiers, JWT authentication & token blacklisting, BCrypt account lockout protection, typed exception handling, OpenAPI/Swagger annotations, and comprehensive unit & integration test coverage.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **REST API & Distributed Rate Limiting Architecture**:
> - **5 TIER Distributed Rate Limiting (Bucket4j + Redis)**:
>   - **TIER 1 (Auth)**: `/auth/register` (5/hr/IP), `/auth/login` (10/hr/IP), `/auth/refresh` (30/hr/user)
>   - **TIER 2 (Report Ingestion)**: `/reports/upload` (10/hr/user), `/reports/abdm-pull` (5/hr/user), `/reports/confirm-value` (30/hr/user)
>   - **TIER 3 (Query & Verification)**: `/query` (30/hr/user), `/claims/verify` (20/hr/user)
>   - **TIER 4 (Read Endpoints)**: `/query/{id}` (100/hr/user), `/session/{id}/history` (60/hr/user)
>   - **TIER 5 (Admin & Internal)**: `/internal/eval/run` (3/hr/adminKey), `/internal/eval/results/*` (60/hr/adminKey)
> - **Response Headers & 429 Payload**:
>   - `X-RateLimit-Limit`, `X-RateLimit-Remaining`, `X-RateLimit-Reset`, `Retry-After`
>   - Standardized 429 JSON response payload with `retry_after_seconds`, `limit`, and `window`.
> - **Authentication & Security**:
>   - JWT Access (15m) & Refresh Tokens (7d) using JJWT `0.12.6`.
>   - Redis Token Blacklisting for `/auth/logout`.
>   - BCrypt password validation with automatic account lockout after 5 consecutive failed attempts.
>   - Admin API key enforcement via `X-Admin-Key` header for `/internal/**`.

